<title>USA: Royal ups qtly to $0.12 shr from $0.06.</title>
<headline>Royal ups qtly to $0.12 shr from $0.06.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Royal Bancshares of Pennsylvania Inc said on Friday that it raised its quarterly Class A dividend to $0.12 from $0.06 per share .</p>
<p>The company also increased its Class B quarterly dividend to $0.138 from $0.069.</p>
<p>Both dividends are payable on February 14 to shareholders of record on January 30.</p>
<p>-- ((New York newsdesk 212-859-1611))</p>
</text>
